This product is derived from tflite-server (https://github.com/ianbmacdonald/tflite-server),
which is itself derived from ort-server (https://github.com/lemonade-sdk/ort-server). Both are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The lineage is:

  ort-server (ONNX Runtime)  ->  tflite-server (LiteRT)  ->  et-server (ExecuTorch)

The /classify contract, manifest handling, tokenizer handling and model-family allowlist in
src/main.cpp come from ort-server's src/main.cpp by way of tflite-server; the inference engine
was changed to an ExecuTorch Module with the XNNPACK delegate. build-prplos-x86_64.sh,
package-release.sh and tools/compare.py follow tflite-server's. tools/export_pte.py follows the
export.py shipped in the lemonade-sdk *-ONNX classifier repositories.

